Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 11:24:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(studio): render hCaptcha only when a site key is set

Platform-mode builds that do not configure NEXT_PUBLIC_HCAPTCHA_SITE_KEY
(for example a self-operated control plane with its own GoTrue) cannot
sign in: the invisible hCaptcha widget never initializes and the sign-in
and forgot-password forms wait on it.

Render the widget only when a site key is configured. Both forms already
treat a missing captcha ref as "no token", so GoTrue instances without
captcha enabled accept the request.
---
 .../SignIn/ForgotPasswordWizard.tsx           | 29 ++++++++++--------
 .../interfaces/SignIn/SignIn.utils.ts         |  7 +++++
 .../interfaces/SignIn/SignInForm.tsx          | 30 ++++++++++---------
 3 files changed, 39 insertions(+), 27 deletions(-)

